  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot about halfway with hot water (from the tap); cover and bring to a boil. Uncover, add salt and pasta, and stir for a few seconds. Cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place tzatziki, vinaigrette, and spices in a large bowl. Stir to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse chickpeas. Add to the bowl with the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, trim, and small dice cucumber. Add to the bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and halve tomatoes lengthwise. Add to the bowl along with the carrots."
    },
    {
      "text": "Thinly slice olives. Add to the bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pasta is done, drain and rinse under cold water to cool. Add to the bowl with the chickpeas and veggies, then stir to combine the pasta salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide pasta salad between plates or bowls and top with feta. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
